msgid "WWWHomePageURL"
msgstr "WWW Home Page URL"

msgid "WWWHomePageURL_DEFINITION"
msgstr "The world wide web address at which the preliminary page of information for the person or organization can be located. NOTE Information on the world wide web for a person or organization may be separated into a number of pages and across a number of host sites, all of which may be linked together. It is assumed that all such information may be referenced from a single page that is termed the home page for that person or organization."

